  "question": {
    "text": "In a shooting competition a man can score <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>1</mn></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math> points for each shot. Then the number of different ways in which he can score <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn></math> in seven shots is",
