  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Required number of ways = Coefficient of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup></math> in <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />= coefficient of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup></math> in <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />= coefficient of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup></math> in <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;(Neglecting the terms higher than <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup></math> )<br /><br />= coefficient of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup></math> in <math><mo>{</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo>}</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mo>=</mo><mn>